 "description": "Attention-pattern patching: make one head attend, at the last position, the way it did on the COUNTERFACTUAL prompt, and leave its values alone — so the question is 'does where this head looks carry the answer', separately from what it moves. `attention_probs` needs eager attention, and its last axis is the keys of the padded batch, so the two prompts must tokenize to the same length row by row; the compiler checks that before any forward (documents/data/weekdays_aligned is the subset of pairs that do, under this tokenizer).",
